1
00:00:00,300 --> 00:00:01,357
Hi friends!

2
00:00:01,357 --> 00:00:03,244
Let's learn opposites!

3
00:00:03,794 --> 00:00:04,945
Up and down!

4
00:00:04,945 --> 00:00:06,173
Hot and cold!

5
00:00:07,523 --> 00:00:09,999
The balloon goes up, up, up!

6
00:00:10,399 --> 00:00:13,042
The ball falls down, down, down!

7
00:00:13,442 --> 00:00:14,529
Up and down!

8
00:00:14,529 --> 00:00:16,123
They are opposites!

9
00:00:17,473 --> 00:00:19,497
The cocoa is hot.

10
00:00:19,897 --> 00:00:21,699
The snowman is cold.

11
00:00:21,699 --> 00:00:22,325
Brrr!

12
00:00:22,725 --> 00:00:23,948
Hot and cold!

13
00:00:23,948 --> 00:00:25,628
They are opposites!

14
00:00:26,979 --> 00:00:29,169
This face is happy.

15
00:00:29,569 --> 00:00:31,640
This face is sad.

16
00:00:32,040 --> 00:00:33,306
Happy and sad!

17
00:00:33,306 --> 00:00:34,944
They are opposites!

18
00:00:36,294 --> 00:00:38,341
The box is open.

19
00:00:38,741 --> 00:00:40,765
The box is closed.

20
00:00:41,165 --> 00:00:42,566
Open and closed!

21
00:00:42,566 --> 00:00:44,189
They are opposites!

22
00:00:45,539 --> 00:00:47,444
The cup is full.

23
00:00:47,844 --> 00:00:49,891
The cup is empty.

24
00:00:50,291 --> 00:00:51,643
Full and empty!

25
00:00:51,643 --> 00:00:53,295
They are opposites!

26
00:00:54,645 --> 00:00:55,687
In the day,

27
00:00:55,687 --> 00:00:57,026
the sun shines.

28
00:00:57,426 --> 00:00:58,312
At night,

29
00:00:58,312 --> 00:00:59,641
the moon glows.

30
00:01:00,041 --> 00:01:01,271
Day and night!

31
00:01:01,271 --> 00:01:02,863
They are opposites!

32
00:01:04,213 --> 00:01:06,006
The car is fast.

33
00:01:06,006 --> 00:01:06,761
Zoom!

34
00:01:07,161 --> 00:01:09,304
The snail is slow.

35
00:01:09,704 --> 00:01:10,943
Fast and slow!

36
00:01:10,943 --> 00:01:12,546
They are opposites!

37
00:01:13,896 --> 00:01:16,182
What is the opposite of hot?

38
00:01:18,382 --> 00:01:19,471
Cold!

39
00:01:20,821 --> 00:01:23,225
What is the opposite of fast?

40
00:01:25,425 --> 00:01:26,373
Slow!

41
00:01:27,723 --> 00:01:29,961
Great job, little learner!

42
00:01:30,511 --> 00:01:32,400
Share Mimzi with a friend,

43
00:01:32,400 --> 00:01:34,939
and subscribe for more learning fun!

44
00:01:35,489 --> 00:01:36,532
Next time,

45
00:01:36,532 --> 00:01:39,098
let's visit the farm animals.

46
00:01:39,348 --> 00:01:40,719
Bye bye!
